1
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,740
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 16=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(Concubine Rou is disfigured.)

4
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,640
Any news from Jinghe Palace?

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,320
I've had people watching.

6
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,840
They'll report to Your Highness at once.

7
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:32,200
Consort Rong took down
Noble Consort Hui.

8
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,360
She's in high favor now.

9
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,320
And she's raising Princess Jinxuan.

10
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,400
She won't be easy to handle.

11
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,600
High favor?

12
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,640
His Majesty's favor

13
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,120
is like the wind.

14
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,080
One day it blows west,

15
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,960
the next east.

16
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:50,880
But I'm different.

17
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,840
My beauty

18
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,440
is the finest
among Jiangnan's Four Wonders.

19
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,120
At the selection,

20
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,320
The moment His Majesty laid eyes on me,

21
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,760
he could not look away.

22
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,760
He even wrote himself that

23
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,720
"All Jiangnan's grace"

24
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,760
"belongs to one lady."

25
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,000
I am

26
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,880
the one whose favor never fades.

27
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,720
Your beauty crowns the harem.

28
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:14,920
No one compares.

29
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,320
Consort Rong

30
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,400
used Jinxuan's fright

31
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,360
to keep His Majesty at Jinghe Palace.

32
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,680
I'll show her that

33
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,920
no matter how clever she is,

34
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,600
one beckon from me

35
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,760
and His Majesty will come running.

36
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,640
How wise, Your Highness.

37
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,240
Jinxiu.

38
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,120
Go to the Imperial Hospital again.

39
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,120
Tell them to add more fine angelica

40
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,920
and white poria to my pearl powder.

41
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,520
And remember,

42
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,960
grind it very fine.

43
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:53,600
Yes.

44
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,720
I'll go at once.

45
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,200
Physician Li.

46
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,760
I need a favor.

47
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,080
Go ahead, Your Highness.

48
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,680
If it's within my power,

49
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,120
I'll do everything I can.

50
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,240
I need a certain medicine.

51
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,200
Aconite powder.

52
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,520
Please prepare some for me.

53
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,800
Aconite powder can be used as medicine,

54
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,000
but it's also poisonous.

55
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,080
What do you need it for?

56
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,080
Concubine Rou confessed

57
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,240
that back then,

58
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,520
because His Majesty

59
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,720
went to visit Lingxi,

60
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,400
she became a laughingstock.

61
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,280
Consumed by jealousy,

62
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,520
she poisoned my Lingxi,
leaving her mute.

63
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,400
It was Concubine Rou?

64
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,440
Appearances can be deceiving.

65
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,560
I never thought it was her.

66
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,280
She relies on her beauty

67
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,560
and flaunts His Majesty's favor.

68
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,880
I'll give her a taste

69
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,360
of her own medicine.

70
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,600
She cares so much about her looks,

71
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,760
so I'll destroy her face.

72
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,320
Destroy what she treasures most.

73
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:01,760
Your Highness.

74
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,800
You can't do that.

75
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,080
Poisoning Concubine Rou

76
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,400
will only drag you deeper.

77
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,400
How will you get out?

78
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,680
Why should I get out?

79
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,680
She used poison
to silence my daughter.

80
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,200
She must pay for what she did.

81
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,640
Fu Rong.

82
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,400
I can't stand by and watch you

83
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,760
cast aside all restraint

84
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:18,120
and fight by any means.

85
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,400
I helped you before

86
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,640
out of compassion,

87
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,800
because I couldn't bear

88
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,000
to leave the truth uncovered.

89
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,640
I wanted justice for Princess Lingxi,

90
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,520
and to clear her name.

91
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,520
But a healer must have compassion.

92
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:28,640
Saving lives

93
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,760
comes first.

94
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,960
Now you'd stop at nothing for revenge,

95
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,880
even poisoning someone.

96
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,280
How are you any different from them?

97
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,640
This will never end.

98
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,480
You'll only sink deeper,

99
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,200
make mistakes,

100
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,160
until there's no way back.

101
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,960
Enough!

102
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,560
I won't hear your preaching.

103
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,840
All I know is

104
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,360
an eye for an eye,

105
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,360
a tooth for a tooth.

106
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,040
She poisoned my daughter.

107
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,800
She must pay for it.

108
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,840
Why does she get to live so well?

109
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,160
Since Physician Li won't help me,

110
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,880
then from now on,

111
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,040
stay out of my affairs.

112
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,360
But...

113
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,200
We should see less of each other.

114
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,940
(Imperial Hospital)

115
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,560
Consort Rong.

116
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,760
What brings you here?

117
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,760
If you need anything,

118
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,760
just send a servant

119
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,240
to summon me.

120
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:18,080
You needn't come all this way.

121
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,360
No need for formalities, Director Zhang.

122
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,600
My old ailment has flared up.

123
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,760
My hands and feet grow cold again.

124
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:26,560
I'd like to ask you for a remedy

125
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:28,000
to help restore my health.

126
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,240
I also hope

127
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,520
to bear His Majesty a child soon.

128
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,000
This way, please.

129
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,240
You have a yang-deficient constitution

130
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,400
and need warming remedies.

131
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,280
If you wish to recover quickly,

132
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:51,040
I can use Sini decoction to
restore your yang

133
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:53,640
and aconite decoction to
warm your meridians.

134
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,600
How effective is it?

135
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,760
Raw aconite powder is toxic,

136
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,520
but once processed,

137
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,600
the poison is removed
and its nature kept.

138
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,760
Soaked in brine,

139
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,320
and steamed with ginger juice.

140
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,080
It should ease your condition.

141
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,040
Please wait a moment.

142
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:14,780
(Dried ginger 2 qian, ginseng 2 qian,
poria 3 qian, and more)

143
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,440
Physician Wang.

144
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,720
I'm here for Concubine Rou's
pearl powder.

145
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:30,920
Your Highness,
here's the prepared aconite powder.

146
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,480
It dispels cold
and unblocks the meridians.

147
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,280
Jinxiu.

148
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:35,080
Here's the pearl powder
for Her Highness.

149
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,080
Thanks, Physician Wang.

150
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,000
Thanks, Director Zhang.

151
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,040
Your Highness.

152
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,960
Chunli.

153
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,000
Watch where you're going!

154
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,200
If Her Highness's pearl powder
gets dirty,

155
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,080
you'll pay for this!

156
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,480
Sorry, Jinxiu.

157
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,480
It was my fault.

158
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,920
I was so careless.

159
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,200
Be careful next time.

160
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,400
So clumsy.

161
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,160
Yes.

162
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:26,640
Jinxuan.

163
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,720
How have you been?

164
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,000
I'm fine, Father.

165
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,440
By Your Majesty's grace,

166
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:34,200
Jinxuan has recovered quite well.

167
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,880
The physicians have checked
several times.

168
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:38,080
They say it was just a bad fright.

169
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,880
With patient care,
she'll recover in time.

170
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,920
Consort Rong.

171
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:45,440
I entrusted Jinxuan to your care

172
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,240
because you're so attentive.

173
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,000
You've worked hard these days.

174
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,560
You honor me, Your Majesty.

175
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,480
I remember your charge

176
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,080
and will care for Jinxuan well.

177
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,280
I won't let you down.

178
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,000
Your Majesty.

179
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:03,240
Concubine Rou requests an audience.

180
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,320
Concubine Rou?

181
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,120
Let her in.

182
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,160
Yes.

183
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:14,000
Your Majesty.

184
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,280
I shouldn't disturb your meal,

185
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,560
but...

186
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,560
You may have forgotten,

187
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:22,360
but you promised me

188
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,160
that on the tenth of this month

189
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,120
you'd visit Yongxiu Palace

190
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:29,040
to taste the peach dew I brewed for you.

191
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,920
Today is the day.

192
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,520
Does your word

193
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,120
still stand?

194
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,600
I would never

195
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,120
break my word.

196
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:42,240
I'll go with you to Yongxiu Palace

197
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,120
for a few drinks.

198
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,240
Consort Rong.

199
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,360
I'll come see you and Jinxuan
another day.

200
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,760
Yes.

201
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,120
Farewell, Your Majesty.

202
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:38,960
Your Majesty...

203
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,760
Concubine Rou.

204
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,960
You're even more lovely tonight.

205
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,400
Your Majesty...

206
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,360
Concubine Rou.

207
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:10,800
What's wrong with your face?

208
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,120
Your Majesty...

209
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,440
My face hurts so much!

210
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:18,800
Guards!

211
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,720
Fetch the physicians!

212
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,840
Director Zhang.

213
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,840
What happened to Concubine Rou's face?

214
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,400
Your Majesty.

215
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,640
May I examine the pearl powder

216
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,520
she applied to her face?

217
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:43,840
Hurry.

218
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,280
Yes.

219
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:56,920
This...

220
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,920
Your Majesty.

221
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:04,160
Her Highness's face shows
signs of poisoning.

222
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,000
Her pearl powder

223
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,840
was mixed with

224
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,800
aconite powder.

225
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:08,920
Aconite powder?

226
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,920
Your Majesty.

227
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:12,080
Aconite is hot-natured and toxic.

228
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,160
It must never be applied to the skin.

229
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,520
It can cause severe burns

230
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,520
and festering sores.

231
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,720
At this dose,

232
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:18,760
I'm afraid

233
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:19,600
her face may...

234
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,440
Spit it out.

235
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,080
I will do my utmost to treat her

236
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,920
and try to keep her

237
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,080
from scarring.

238
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,320
Your Majesty...

239
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,760
Your Majesty.

240
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,840
Someone has poisoned me!

241
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,760
I beg you, give me justice!

242
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,800
Director Zhang.

243
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,880
medicines here are strictly controlled.

244
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,680
Now that this has happened,

245
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,280
if you can't find the culprit,

246
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,760
I'll have your head!

247
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,800
Your Majesty.

248
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,680
All medicines in and out

249
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,600
are recorded and can be traced.

250
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:52,400
I recall

251
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:54,160
the last person to take aconite powder

252
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,800
was...

253
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,080
Consort Rong.

254
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,840
This afternoon, Consort Rong
requested warming medicine.

255
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,800
so I wrote her a prescription.

256
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:03,720
It included aconite powder.

257
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:06,560
Your Majesty.

258
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,240
Your Highness.

259
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,360
This afternoon I went to
get the pearl powder.

260
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,080
Chunli, Consort Rong's maid,

261
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,320
deliberately bumped into me.

262
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,280
It must be them.

263
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,960
They must have tampered

264
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:16,080
with her pearl powder.

265
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,680
Consort Rong...

266
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,320
Summon Consort Rong!

267
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,400
Yes.

268
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,360
Your Majesty.

269
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,640
Consort Rong.

270
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,480
You took aconite powder today.

271
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:31,640
Is that true?

272
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,320
It is.

273
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,040
I have a cold constitution,

274
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,280
so I requested a warming remedy.

275
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,840
It contained aconite.

276
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,880
But I did not

277
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,680
poison Concubine Rou.

278
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:41,960
I beg Your Majesty to judge fairly.

279
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,280
Such a coincidence?

280
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,840
You just took aconite powder,

281
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:46,120
and I'm poisoned.

282
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,480
You claim it wasn't you.

283
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:48,640
Can you prove it?

284
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,280
Your Majesty.

285
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,920
We searched Jinghe Palace.

286
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,640
We did find aconite powder

287
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,120
in Consort Rong's quarters.

288
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,080
Furthermore,

289
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:02,080
a palace maid from Jinghe Palace

290
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,120
came forward to

291
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,400
report that

292
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,480
Consort Rong

293
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,480
poisoned Concubine Rou.

294
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:09,000
Bring her in.

295
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:10,440
Come in.

296
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,880
I'm Suxin, a menial maid
from Jinghe Palace.

297
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,400
Your Majesty.

298
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:18,760
Tell me

299
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,120
everything you know.

300
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,200
A few days ago, while on duty,

301
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,600
I overheard

302
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,560
Consort Rong

303
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:26,400
asking Physician Li for aconite powder.

304
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:27,920
But he refused.

305
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,600
Then Consort Rong said

306
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,600
Concubine Rou used her beauty
to secure Your Majesty's favor

307
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,480
and grew arrogant.

308
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,920
She wanted to ruin her face.

309
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,360
Your Majesty,

310
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,720
you've heard it yourself.

311
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,680
Now we have a witness and evidence.

312
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:40,760
Consort Rong,

313
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,280
she envies the favor you bestow on me.

314
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,760
Please give me justice, Your Majesty!

315
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,600
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

316
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,080
I needed the aconite powder

317
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,480
because of my cold constitution.

318
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:55,040
I wanted to restore my health
and bear you an heir.

319
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,360
I never meant to harm anyone.

320
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,600
Someone

321
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,280
must be framing me.

322
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:00,440
Please see the truth.

323
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,920
Everyone in the harem knows

324
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,040
Concubine Rou treasures her beauty most.

325
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,680
You say someone framed you.

326
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,520
Would she ruin her own face
just to frame you?

327
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,840
Consort Rong...

328
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,960
You've disappointed me!

329
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,000
Effective immediately,

330
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,280
Consort Rong is demoted to Zhaoyi.

331
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,560
One year's stipend docked,

332
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,760
as a warning to all.

333
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:22,880
Yes.

334
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,680
Take her away!

335
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:27,200
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

336
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,600
I'm innocent!

337
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,960
I didn't poison her!

338
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:32,240
I'm being framed.

339
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:33,320
Your Majesty.

340
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,240
My face...

341
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:42,800
(Fu Rong.)

342
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,040
(I know you're innocent.)

343
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:47,280
(You wanted to ruin my beauty.)

344
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,320
(So I play along)

345
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,400
(and make His Majesty
lose faith in you.)

346
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,000
(Do you think)

347
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,000
(I'm just a pretty face with no brains?)

348
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,080
(You're far too naive.)

349
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,560
(Today, I'll show you)

350
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,920
(what I'm capable of.)

351
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:08,380
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

352
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:13,420
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

353
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:18,220
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

354
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:23,060
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

355
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:27,820
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

356
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:32,860
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

357
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:37,660
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

358
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:42,620
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

359
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:47,380
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

360
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:50,780
♪Let the stars and sea♪

361
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,780
(Changsheng Gate)

362
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:56,100
♪Wait for your return♪
